{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<img alt=\"採訪日誌｜李家超出席北京香港經濟合作研討洽談會／科大舉辦世界頂尖大學校長論壇\" src=\"https://news.now.com/nownews/NewsImage/REPORTER-DIARY-261104.jpg\"><p>【Now新聞台】第29屆北京香港經濟合作研討洽談會今日在北京開幕，行政長官李家超出席開幕式並致辭。另外，科大舉辦世界頂尖大學校長論壇，逾50所頂尖大學領袖深入交流。</p></body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-04T00:00:31.592521+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":82,"images":1,"source":"Now 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-03T23:36:28+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-04T13:38:24.574228+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-03T23:58:33.296009+00:00","content_hash":"ac73359134469a000c9d67adbe8a906c951d6bc3f59b63323f7384c46843ed83","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-04T00:00:31.592521+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}